#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32L0 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32L0 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (L010, L011, L021, L031, L041, L051, L052, L053, L062, L063, L071, L072, L073, L081, L082, L083)
